{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And I made an ark.</b> At the command 'and it shall be' — its explanation is in 'and Moses assembled.' Moses had already assembled. And I have already shown you many who say so, and all this is because it says, 'and they were there, as YHWH commanded me,' and this is 'and you shall place the testimony into the ark.' It is also possible that its explanation applies to 'and you shall make yourself an ark of wood,' and the tradition prevails."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:56.340400692Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}